<h1>3-2-1 Transformation</h1>
<hr class="whs4" style="height:6px; width:98.974%; float:alignleft;" size="6" width="98.974%" align="left">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <b><i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal;"><span class="Path">Transformations &gt;</span></i></b> <span lang="EN-GB"><i style="font-weight:bold;">3-2-1...</i></span></p>
<p class="Description"><b style="font-weight:bold;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">The command</span> <span lang="EN-GB">3-2-1</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;">allows the user to</span></b> <span lang="EN-GB">construct transformation from a plane, line, and point. The name of the entity is ‘321 Transformation’.</span></p>
<p class="Example"><img src="using_datums_files/image069.gif" width="368px" height="498px" border="0" class="img_whs3" alt=""></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB">Plane</span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Select a plane from the list of existing datum planes and plane reducible entities.</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Co-ordinate Frame</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Select the co-ordinate frame for the plane, which is to be defined. The frames are OXY, OYZ, and OXZ.</span></p>
<p class="whs4"><span lang="EN-GB"><u><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Scheme</a></u></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP221032808" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="Images/321plane.gif" width="273px" height="147px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
</div>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP78710705" style="display:none; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><script type="text/javascript" language="JavaScript">
<!--
if ((navigator.appName == "Netscape") && (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) <= 4)) 
{  if (parseInt(navigator.appVersion) != 2) document.write("<img src='Using_Datums_files/image070.gif' class='img_whs7' border='0'>");}
else
{   document.write("<img src='Using_Datums_files/image070.gif' class='img_whs7' style='border-style: none; border-style: none;' border='0'>");}
//-->
</script></p>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Line</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Define an axis on the plane in one of two ways:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>From list</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– choose a line from the list of existing datum lines and line reducible entities. The projection of this line on the plane will define the axis that is selected from the Axis list. Note that the line should not have to be orthogonal to the plane.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Plane intersection</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– select an existing datum plane or plane reducible entity, which intersects with the first plane. Note that this plane should not have to be parallel to the first plane. The line defined from the intersection of these two planes will define the axis that is selected from the Axis list.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Axis</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– choose an axis on the plane. A proper axis should be selected. For example, if you selected co-ordinate frame OXY, the valid axes are +X, -X, +Y, and -Y. If you choose +X, Y-axis will be defined as line laying on the plane and orthogonal to X-axis. Z-axis will be defined as line orthogonal to the plane.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Bullet" style="font-weight:normal; text-decoration:underline;"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a3" style="text-decoration:underline;">Scheme</a></span></b></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP161881251" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
