<p>Axis defined by intersection of planes</p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</div>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Origin</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Defines the origin point for the co-ordinate system in one of the two ways:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>From list</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– choose a point of origin from the list of existing datum points and point reducible entities. The projection of this point on the plane will define the origin.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Project point on the plane</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">- if this checkbox is enabled, the selected point will be projected on the plane to define the origin. If disabled, the selected point it self will be set as origin. This option is enabled by default.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet" style="font-weight:normal;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Line intersection</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– select an existing datum line or line reducible entity, which intersects with the plane. Note that this line should not have to be parallel to the plane and to the axis defined on it. The intersection between the line and the plane will define the origin.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Plane intersection</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">– select an existing datum plane or plane reducible entity, which intersects with the first plane. Note that this plane should not have to be parallel to the first plane and to the axis defined on it. The intersection between the defined axis and the line produced of the intersection between the two planes, will define the origin.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="whs14"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:normal;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a4" style="text-decoration:underline;">S<span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>cheme</u></span></a></span></b></p>
